# state: first-run
# The Simpsons Hit & Run (56550015), FIRST RUN: no profile exists for this title yet (#433 step 5,
# lane.pathclass). Opens with the generic `drive` fallback this lane built in step 3 -- the same
# path lane.nfsdefault1011's blind `repeat 30 { press START; wait 2.5; press A; wait 2.5 }` loop
# covers on this title (route.txt of 1-1791745785-nfsdefault1011-877404: logos, intro cinematic,
# title "PRESS START", sky cutscene, main menu NEW GAME, five character cutscenes, loading,
# tutorial boxes A=Continue, free control at ~152 s) -- but screen-aware instead of blind, so it
# cannot repeat that run's ~2-minute post-arrival START/A survey loop (owner, 2026-10-11).
# `find` (not `mark`): this step only needs to KNOW play was reached, not drive it for the whole
# window -- see forza-soak1010.route's comment on find vs mark. 240 s budgets ~90 s over the known
# 152 s path.
#
# EXPLORATORY TAIL (not yet proven on this title): the pause-menu Save Game sequence below is
# written from the pause menu's documented layout (Continue / Level Progress / Options / Save Game
# / Quit to Main Menu -- strategywiki/sierrachest walkthroughs, not this lane's own frames) and from
# midnight-club-3.returning.route's proven convention on this pad (`axis HATY max` / `axis HATY mid`,
# no wait between the pair, moves the highlight down exactly one row). Three pulses: Continue ->
# Level Progress -> Options -> Save Game. Shots at every stage so one run's frames can confirm or
# correct this before it is trusted -- this route ends `mark save-attempted`, not `mark
# profile-saved`, until a captured frame actually shows the save completing (NOTES.md "Step 5").
drive generic 240 find
wait 2.0
shot free-roam
press START
wait 2.0
shot pause-menu
axis HATY max
axis HATY mid
axis HATY max
axis HATY mid
axis HATY max
axis HATY mid
wait 1.0
shot pause-save-highlighted
press A
wait 3.0
shot after-select-save
press A
wait 2.0
shot after-confirm
mark save-attempted
